BEHAVIOR send

DESCRIPTION
  Sends data on a connected socket.
  Returns number of bytes sent, negative on error.
  May send fewer bytes than requested.
  Data is a raw byte buffer with an explicit length; a socket sends bytes.
  To send a string, translate it to bytes first (string-to-bytes).

CONTRACT
  INPUT fd int 8
  INPUT data bytes 65536
  INPUT length int 8
  OUTPUT bytes_sent int 8
  GUARANTEES writes_output

HASH 8c6f3cb7

NATIVE
